  {
    "id": "ddtree",
    "name": "DDTree",
    "title": "DDTree — Accelerating Speculative Decoding with Block Diffusion Draft Trees",
    "date": "2026-04-14",
    "dateLabel": "2026-04-14",
    "category": "tree",
    "tags": [],
    "summary": "把 DFlash 从“一条路径”变成“候选树”",
    "problem": "DFlash 每个位置都有完整概率分布，但最终只选一条序列，大量候选概率被浪费",
    "solution": "从各位置 top-k 分布构建 draft tree，best-first 搜索，在固定 node budget 下选择高概率路径，再一次性验证整棵树。",
    "paperUrl": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.12989",
    "sourceUrl": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.12989",
    "code": [
